{"id":"n1-131","title":"Verb てからというもの (Verb te kara to iu mono)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses that ever since a certain event happened, a condition has continued until now.","longExplanation":"The てからというもの grammar point indicates that from the time a certain action happened, a significant change or condition has persisted continuously. It emphasizes that the new situation contrasts with what came before.","formation":"Verb-て form + からというもの","examples":[{"jp":"彼女と別れてからというもの、一人で過ごす時間が増えました。","romaji":"Kanojo to wakarete kara to iu mono, hitori de sugosu jikan ga fuemashita.","en":"Ever since I broke up with her, I've spent more time alone.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"別れ","vocabId":"1509490","reading":"わかれ","baseForm":"別れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"という","vocabId":null},{"surface":"もの","vocabId":"1322990","reading":"もの"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"一","vocabId":"1160790","reading":"いち"},{"surface":"人","vocabId":"1580640","reading":"ひと"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"過ごす","vocabId":"1196000","reading":"すごす"},{"surface":"時間","vocabId":"1315920","reading":"じかん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"増え","vocabId":"1602440","reading":"ふえる","baseForm":"増える"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"子供が生まれてからというもの、自由な時間がなくなった。","romaji":"Kodomo ga umarete kara to iu mono, jiyū na jikan ga nakunatta.","en":"Since the baby was born, I have had no free time.","words":[{"surface":"子供","vocabId":"1307850","reading":"こども"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"生まれ","vocabId":"1609350","reading":"うまれ","baseForm":"生まれる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"という","vocabId":null},{"surface":"もの","vocabId":"1322990","reading":"もの"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"